resources.string:
Your projects, videos and photos stay on your device. We don't sell your data and we don't send your videos to anyone.

Only what the app needs to work leaves your device:
• your account email and password, so you can sign in;
• app crash reports (without your videos), so we can fix bugs;
• Google's advertising ID, used by the ads;
• whatever you choose to send to the online AI features and to the community.
